      "proof_trace": "The anti-equivocation check (spec requirement #12) is delegated to seenGossipBlockInput which keys by blockRootHex. Two equivocating columns (same slot, proposer, index but different content/signatures) have different blockRootHex values, so both pass validation. Unlike block validation which uses seenBlockProposers keyed by (slot, proposer), columns lack per-(slot, proposer, index) deduplication.",
      "attack_scenario": "Malicious proposer sends two DataColumnSidecars for (slot=N, proposer=V, index=I) with different content and valid signatures. Both are accepted and stored under different blockRootHex keys, enabling equivocation attacks.",
      "checklist_id": "PROP-6a4369e9-inv-013"
    },
    "text": "Anti-equivocation cache must be updated for all imported data columns regardless of publishing.",
    "assertion": "forall col: imported(col) => anti_equivocation_cache.contains(col.key)",
    "covers": "SG-010",
    "severity": "HIGH",
    "type": "invariant"
  }
}

